  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Blended Finance for Energy Transition (BFET) &#x2013; capital contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Blended Finance for Energy Transition (BFET) is to catalyse the mobilisation of up to USD 1bn from private investors by leveraging up to USD 50  of catalytic donor capital . The Ministry of Foreign Affairs supported IFU&#x2019;s participation in BFET with a capital contribution of DKK 100 million to IFU&#x2019;s equity. The BFET capital will work to reduce GHG emissions in high-emitting middle-income countries with at least 51% focus on the JETP relevant countries India, Indonesia, Vietnam and South Africa. The mobilised investments will create quality jobs directly in the energy sector and indirectly from increased growth.</narrative>
  </description>
